/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Created an infographic narrative on Smart Farming by translating agricultural, demographic, and economic data into a compelling visual format. Mapped national trends in modern technology adoption among farmers, identified regional disparities, and emphasized the potential of 6.18 million millennial farmers. Combined geospatial data, time series, and sectoral statistics to highlight the urgency of digital transformation in agriculture and its alignment with SDG 2 \("Zero Hunger"\).)
